<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun International started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun International started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said analyst Joseph Coccimiglio initiated coverage of Sun International Hotels Ltd with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 to 37-1/4.</p>
</text>
